doc: ExtAddOrRemoveCounter: AddOrRemoveCounter (gorge effAddOrRemoveCounter): for the target or Defined$ object in Obj and the amount in B, pose gorge's remove-then-put election to the resolving controller for the named counter kind in C, or with C -1 for each counter kind the object holds; the put runs an ordinary OpPutCounter (replacements, the CR 616.1 order ask and CounterAddedOnce), the remove marks the kind seen and subtracts what the object holds. dirac/ctr_addorremove.go.
